     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Kinds of soil",
     "md": "**Sandy soil** has big grains, drains water quickly. **Clay soil** has tiny grains, holds water and gets sticky. **Loam** is a mix with much humus; it is good for growing crops. In much of Cameroon, red and dark volcanic soils are good for farming (for example near Mount Cameroon)."
    },
